              },
              {
                "question": "How do I know if my brakes need to be replaced?",
                "answer": "Common signs include squealing or grinding noises, a soft or spongy brake pedal, the car pulling to one side while braking, vibration, or a brake warning light on the dashboard."
              },
              {
                "question": "What steps can I take between services?",
                "answer": "Regularly check tyre pressure, engine oil and coolant levels, keep your lights and wipers working, and keep the car clean. Listen for unusual noises and get them checked early."
              },
              {
                "question": "Can I book an appointment online?",
                "answer": "Yes, you can book a service online through our Book a Service button or call us directly. Choose a convenient time and our team will confirm your appointment."
